  "[Companion Name] turns towards you and wobbles on their feet. Even in the low light, you notice the dark red patch blood on the front of their cloak, and trailing down their arms. You rush towards them and manage to catch your best friend before they hit the ground. You quickly run through a list of places you could bring them before settling on their own place. You quickly fish their key out of their pocket and carry them inside. You'd complain about them being heavy if it weren't for the fact your heart was beating out of your chest, knowing how hurt they are and having no idea on why or how.\n\nDigging through both their supplies and yours, you find enough to get them patched up. Across their chest is a large gash with bits of... wood, sticking out of it? You extract it all, bit by bit, in the lantern light, and stitch them back up before wrapping them in gauze. The rest of their wounds are comparatively minor, and take much less time to deal with, but they are numerous, and in various states of healing, some old, some fresh.\n\nOnce you're done, [Companion Name] looks more mummy than person, but they'll live. You cover them up to let them rest, and decide to help along their recovery with their favorite food.": "[Companion Name]转向你，脚步摇晃。即使光线昏暗，你也看见了斗篷前襟那片暗红的血迹，还有沿着双臂流下的鲜血。你冲过去，在挚友倒地前接住了对方。你飞快地想着能把对方带去哪里，最后决定先回对方家中。你迅速从口袋里摸出钥匙，把人抱进屋。要不是担心得心都快跳出胸口，你一定会抱怨这家伙真重。对方伤得如此严重，而你完全不知道究竟发生了什么。\n\n你翻遍了两人的物资，总算凑够处理伤口的用品。对方胸口有一道巨大的伤口，里面竟然扎着些……木头碎片？你借着提灯的光，把碎片一点点取出，缝合伤口，再裹上纱布。其余伤口相比之下都不算严重，处理起来也快得多，但数量很多，愈合程度各异，有旧伤，也有新伤。\n\n忙完以后，[Companion Name]看起来更像木乃伊，但命算是保住了。你给对方盖好被子，让其休息，又决定做些对方最爱吃的东西，帮助恢复。",
  "Hire a Farmhand III that unlocks automations for all Farming actions with a [b]Farming Level requirement less than [color=orange]80[/color][/b]. Requires Wine as payment for their services.": "雇用农工 III，为所有[b]种植等级要求低于[color=orange]80[/color][/b]的种植操作解锁自动化。需用葡萄酒支付报酬。",
  "Hire a Farmhand IV that unlocks automations for all Farming actions with a [b]Farming Level requirement less than [color=orange]99[/color][/b]. Requires Wine as payment for their services.": "雇用农工 IV，为所有[b]种植等级要求低于[color=orange]99[/color][/b]的种植操作解锁自动化。需用葡萄酒支付报酬。",
